                                            "That grows in rubbish or poor soil"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "283e3146-c1e5-44cf-80f7-e92da44e3ee4",
                                                "sense_id": "a1088426-4cb2-3674-b33b-da7197ea04a8",
                                                "text": "Rafinesque perfected his variant of this honorable philosophy while botanizing in the literal backyards of my childhood, examining ruderal plants I've known all my life, and so I have appropriated it from him, with minor tweaks."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
